#. y1:english="What happened?\nHuh?{PA:10} Umm,{PA:10} well...||We were just at a club called Deborah...\nBut we got thrown out.\nIt sucks, because we rented out||the VIP section!\nWho threw you out?\nI'm not really sure.{PA:20}\nBut by the way they dressed,||I'd say they were Yakuza.\nYeah,{PA:10} for sure!\nDeborah, right?\nYeah.{PA:20}||It's right in front of Theatre Square.\nBut I don't think it's such a good idea to||go up there now...\nThey're up to something.{PA:20}||I'd watch out, you might get killed!!"
